"\n"
"#. Just install this module.\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Go to the users settings.\n"
"#. Check if the user has the contact creation access.\n"
"\n"
